    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.95.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Le nouvel objet Transpondeur permet aux builds tank de g\xE9n\xE9rer
        passivement de la menace."
      baseValue: "\u2022 New Transponder item allows tank builds to passively gain
        threat on enemies."
