    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.16
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Bouclier de protection bloque au bord de la bulle, m\xEAme activ\xE9
        sans boucliers."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Shield Ward now blocks at the bubble edge even when used
        with shields down."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.17
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Les malus ne traversent plus un Bouclier de protection actif."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Debuffs no longer pierce an active Shield Ward."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.92.18
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 L'ombre et les contours d'\xE9tat ne r\xE9v\xE8lent plus les
        vaisseaux en D\xE9phasage."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship shadow and status outlines no longer reveal ships hidden
        by Phase Shift."
