    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.6
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Les pr\xE9r\xE9glages de difficult\xE9 troquent vos d\xE9g\xE2ts
        contre des ennemis plus coriaces, plus nombreux et plus de r\xE9cup\xE9ration."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Difficulty presets trade damage for tougher ships, more
        enemies, more salvage."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.7
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Les Eels se d\xE9placent d\xE9sormais 20\_% plus lentement."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Eels now move 20% slower."
