    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.31
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Les valeurs max. des modificateurs du Glossaire refl\xE8tent
        les plafonds Rare et L\xE9gendaire relev\xE9s."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Glossary max modifier values now reflect the higher Rare
        and Legendary caps."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.32
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Les cartes stellaires du Radar et de la Navigation s'accordent
        enfin sur les \xE9toiles contenant du butin."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Radar and Navigation star maps no longer disagree on which
        stars hold loot."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.33
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Correction d'une erreur apr\xE8s la destruction d'un chef d'escadron
        sous contr\xF4le mental."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed an error after a mind-controlled squadron leader was
        destroyed."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.34
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Correction des missiles Tornado qui zigzaguaient au lancement
        \xE0 cause d'un amortissement lent."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Fixed Tornado missiles zigzagging at launch due to slow
        steering damping."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.35
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Les lasers de d\xE9fense ponctuelle ne visent plus les missiles
        inoffensifs d'alli\xE9s partis."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Point Defense Lasers no longer target harmless missiles
        from departed allies."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.36
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 L'annulation apr\xE8s le chargement d'un mod\xE8le ou d'un import
        restaure votre vaisseau pr\xE9c\xE9dent."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Undo after loading a template or import now restores your
        previous ship."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.37
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 La liste des pi\xE8ces du Concepteur de vaisseaux ne s'ouvre
        plus d\xE9j\xE0 d\xE9fil\xE9e."
      baseValue: "\u2022 The Ship Builder parts list no longer opens scrolled partway
        along."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.38
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 La s\xE9lection \xE0 la manette ne choisit plus d'\xE9l\xE9ments
        de liste hors de vue."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Controller selection no longer picks list items scrolled
        out of view."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.39
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Les puits de gravit\xE9 et les trous noirs ne font plus voler
        les segments des ennemis serpents."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Gravity wells and black holes no longer send snake enemy
        segments flying."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.40
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Les segments des ennemis serpents ne s'\xE9cartent plus quand
        beaucoup de vaisseaux combattent."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Snake enemy segments no longer drift apart when many ships
        are in the fight."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: core.updateHistory.v0.7.91.41
      type: 13
      value: "\u2022 Les anneaux de slot de propulseur du Concepteur s'affichent
        d\xE9sormais au-dessus de la coque."
      baseValue: "\u2022 Ship Builder thruster slot rings now show above the hull
        instead of under it."
