    - key: roadmap.0
      type: 9
      value: "Am\xE9liorations visuelles"
      baseValue: Visual Improvements
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.1.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Effets des projectiles
      baseValue: Projectile Effects
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.1.description
      type: 9
      value: "Am\xE9liorer les effets visuels des particules et des impacts pour
        rendre les armes plus satisfaisantes \xE0 utiliser."
      baseValue: Improve the visual effects of particles and hit effects so weapons
        are more satisfying to use.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.2
      type: 9
      value: "Diversit\xE9 des builds"
      baseValue: Build Diversity
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.3.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Briseur de limites
      baseValue: Limit Breaker
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.3.description
      type: 9
      value: "Supprime la limite de 4 slots par type, permettant aux concepts de
        vaisseaux d'avoir un nombre quelconque de slots principaux, secondaires,
        sp\xE9ciaux ou sp\xE9ciaux automatiques."
      baseValue: Remove the 4 slot limit on slot types allowing ship designs to have
        any number of primary, secondary, special or auto special slots.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.4.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Refonte des am\xE9liorations"
      baseValue: Upgrade Overhaul
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.4.description
      type: 9
      value: "Refonte de l'arbre d'am\xE9liorations pour permettre diff\xE9rents
        styles de jeu et offrir plus de libert\xE9. Ajout de la possibilit\xE9 de
        cr\xE9er des vaisseaux plus r\xE9sistants et plus rapides."
      baseValue: Rework the upgrade tree to allow for different play styles and more
        freedom. Adding support for tankier builds and faster ships.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.5.subheader
      type: 9
      value: Classes secondaires
      baseValue: Secondary Classes
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.5.description
      type: 9
      value: "Ajout d'un large \xE9ventail de classes secondaires, chacune construite
        autour de styles de jeu distincts avec de fortes sp\xE9cialisations par type
        de d\xE9g\xE2ts."
      baseValue: Add a wide range of secondary classes, each built around distinct
        playstyles with strong damage type specialisations.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.6.subheader
      type: 9
      value: "Combat rapproch\xE9"
      baseValue: Close Combat
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.6.description
      type: 9
      value: "Ajout d'une nouvelle classe secondaire de combat rapproch\xE9 ainsi
        que des armes faux et halo (aura)."
      baseValue: Add a new close combat secondary class along with scythe and halo
        (aura) weapons.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: roadmap.7
      type: 9
      value: Secteur 4
      baseValue: Sector 4
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
