      type: 8
      value: "D\xE9finit la raret\xE9 minimale des \xE9quipements que vous pourrez
        tracter et ramasser."
      baseValue: Set the minimum rarity of equipment you will be able to tractor
        and pick up.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
