    - key: GlossaryPanel.statusEffectReactionsHeading
      type: 9
      value: "R\xE9actions"
      baseValue: Reactions
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: GlossaryPanel.statusEffectReactionsIntro
      type: 9
      value: "Lorsqu'un ennemi subit deux de ces malus en m\xEAme temps, une r\xE9action
        se d\xE9clenche. Les deux malus restent appliqu\xE9s, mais aucune r\xE9action
        ne peut se d\xE9clencher \xE0 nouveau sur cet ennemi pendant 1 seconde. Le
        diagramme indique quelles paires d\xE9clenchent quelle r\xE9action. Les d\xE9g\xE2ts
        et la probabilit\xE9 d'appliquer un malus sur les impacts d'une r\xE9action
        proviennent tous deux de l'arme ayant appliqu\xE9 le malus d\xE9clencheur,
        si bien que les r\xE9actions peuvent s'encha\xEEner en d'autres r\xE9actions."
      baseValue: When an enemy carries two of these debuffs at the same time, a reaction
        fires. Both debuffs stay applied, but no reaction can trigger on that enemy
        again for 1 second. The diagram shows which pairs trigger which reaction.
        Both the damage and the debuff chance on a reaction's hits come from the
        weapon that applied the triggering debuff, so reactions can chain into more
        reactions.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
