  - categoryName: Component.StarMapDifficulty
    entries:
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyRelaxedDesc
      type: 8
      value: "D\xE9tendez-vous et profitez de l'histoire avec un d\xE9fi plus accessible,
        o\xF9 les ennemis sont plus faibles et plus indulgents."
      baseValue: Relax and enjoy the story with an easier challenge, where enemies
        are weaker and more forgiving.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyNormalDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Recommand\xE9 pour une premi\xE8re partie. Un d\xE9fi mod\xE9r\xE9
        pour vous familiariser avec le jeu."
      baseValue: Recommended for your first play through. A moderate challenge as
        you learn about the game.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyChallengingDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Un d\xE9fi solide pour les joueurs exp\xE9riment\xE9s du jeu ou du
        genre qui aiment les d\xE9fis d\xE8s le d\xE9but."
      baseValue: A solid challenge for experienced players of the game or genre who
        like a challenge from the start.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyFormidableDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Vous avez d\xE9j\xE0 jou\xE9 \xE0 ce jeu de nombreuses fois et peaufin\xE9
        vos builds par des essais et erreurs m\xE9ticuleux."
      baseValue: You've played this game many times before and have refined your
        builds through meticulous trial and error.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyImpossibleDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Vous avez r\xE9dig\xE9 plusieurs feuilles de calcul sur ce jeu avec
        des \xE9quations complexes, et vous les avez m\xE9moris\xE9es."
      baseValue: You've written multiple spreadsheets about this game that include
        complicated equations and memorized them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: StarMapDifficulty.difficultyCustomDesc
      type: 8
      value: "Vous \xEAtes un rebelle. Personne ne vous dit comment jouer, alors
        r\xE9glez les param\xE8tres comme bon vous semble."
      baseValue: You're a rebel. Nobody tells you how to play the game so set the
        settings to whatever you damn well please.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
