    entries:
    - key: rYaZS5Ys.name
      type: 5
      value: Alpha Saxa
      baseValue: Alpha Saxa
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: Z54HZzWp.name
      type: 5
      value: Astralis
      baseValue: Astralis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Il \xE9tait temps que je voie un visage amical\_! O\xF9 est le vieux
        Gid\_?"
      baseValue: About time I saw a friendly face! Where's ol' Gid?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Novus Prime... Je t'enverrai les coordonn\xE9es."
      baseValue: Novus Prime... I'll send you the coordinates.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Z54HZzWp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "L'hyperpropulseur fait des siennes... ce fichu engin n'en fait qu'\xE0
        sa t\xEAte. Il me faut un peu de temps. \xC9loignez ces ennemis de moi, vous
        voulez bien\_?"
      baseValue: Hyperdrive's actin' up... bloody thing's got a mind of its own.
        I'll need a wee bit o' time. Keep those hostiles off me, will ya?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.name
      type: 5
      value: Avalon
      baseValue: Avalon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Votre incursion s'arr\xEAte ici. Vous \xEAtes d\xE9sesp\xE9r\xE9ment
        d\xE9pass\xE9\_!"
      baseValue: Your incursion ends here. You are hopelessly outmatched!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Je n'en serais pas si s\xFBr."
      baseValue: I wouldn't be so sure about that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "\xC0 tous les vaisseaux, concentrez vos tirs sur la Citadelle. \xC7a
        se termine ici\_!"
      baseValue: All ships, focus fire on the Citadel. This ends here!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "La coque est sur le point de c\xE9der. Je fais d\xE9gager l'\xE9quipage\u2026
        c'est \xE0 vous de jouer."
      baseValue: Hull's about to give. I'm getting the crew clear... it's on you
        now.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PiwXpqcc.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Bon travail. Maintenant, placez cette pierre angulaire dans le portail
        du secteur. Nous n'avons pas fini\_!"
      baseValue: Good work. Now, go place that keystone in the sector gateway. We're
        not done yet!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.name
      type: 5
      value: Infernum
      baseValue: Infernum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: C'est un gros serpent...
      baseValue: That's a big snake...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: shBT47eM.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Je vous \xE9pargne la blague \xE9vidente..."
      baseValue: I'll spare you the obvious joke...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.name
      type: 5
      value: "Tomb\xE9e de la nuit"
      baseValue: Nightfall
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Satan\xE9s cultistes. Je parie qu'ils croient aux extraterrestres."
      baseValue: Damn cultists. I bet they believe in aliens.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Avez-vous rat\xE9 tous les extraterrestres que nous avons combattus\_?"
      baseValue: Did you miss all the aliens we've been fighting?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Oubli\xE9s sont les souvenirs du futur\_!"
      baseValue: Forgotten are the memories of the future!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lcAfYiDp.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: Peu importe. Ne buvez simplement pas leur Kool-Aid.
      baseValue: Whatever. Just don't drink any of their Kool-Aid.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: gkWSs2X1.name
      type: 5
      value: Novus Prime
      baseValue: Novus Prime
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: z8m42dFQ.name
      type: 5
      value: "P\xE9riculum"
      baseValue: Periculum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.name
      type: 5
      value: Serenity
      baseValue: Serenity
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous ne pouvez pas me prendre le ciel\_!"
      baseValue: You can't take the sky from me!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "De quoi parlez-vous\_?"
      baseValue: What are you talking about?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Juste quelque chose d'une des s\xE9ries t\xE9l\xE9vis\xE9es que j'ai
        gard\xE9es."
      baseValue: Just something from one of the TV series I kept.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Je vais vous montrer un monde sans p\xE9ch\xE9."
      baseValue: I'm going to show you a world without sin.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0lTPPaVb.arrivalDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: "Vous voyez\_? Il a compris la r\xE9f\xE9rence..."
      baseValue: See? He got the reference...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.name
      type: 5
      value: Virenum
      baseValue: Virenum
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Je d\xE9tecte des niveaux de radiation dangereusement \xE9lev\xE9s."
      baseValue: I'm detecting dangerously high levels of radiation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "N'est-ce pas simplement l'espace en g\xE9n\xE9ral\_?"
      baseValue: Isn't that just space in general?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "C'est plus \xE9lev\xE9 que la normale. Ce vaisseau en laisse \xE9chapper
        de partout."
      baseValue: This is higher than normal. That ship is leaking it everywhere.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: frtmSpS2.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "G\xE9nial. Juste ce dont nous avions besoin..."
      baseValue: Great. Just what we needed...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: R2NUkvrp.name
      type: 5
      value: Point de navigation Alpha
      baseValue: Waypoint Alpha
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: wErwJOkj.name
      type: 5
      value: Point de navigation Beta
      baseValue: Waypoint Beta
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: UcQcZrfr.name
      type: 5
      value: Point de navigation Gamma
      baseValue: Waypoint Gamma
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: TEyzaBb4.name
      type: 5
      value: Asgard
      baseValue: Asgard
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: T748amiF.name
      type: 5
      value: Bastion
      baseValue: Bastion
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Un vaisseau Conclave... inattendu. Venez-vous voir \xE0 quoi ressemble
        vraiment la libert\xE9\_?"
      baseValue: A Conclave ship... unexpected. Do you come to see what freedom truly
        looks like?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Je vais l\xE0 o\xF9 je dois aller."
      baseValue: I go where I need to.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Alors regardez bien. C'est ce que craint le Conclave, ce qu'il ne pourra
        jamais contr\xF4ler."
      baseValue: Then take a good look. This is what the Conclave fears, what it
        could never control.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: T748amiF.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "J'aime bien ces gars-l\xE0..."
      baseValue: I kind of like these guys...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.name
      type: 5
      value: "Bifr\xF6st"
      baseValue: "Bifr\xF6st"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Oh, regardez\_! Double probl\xE8me. Un couple qui fait \xE9quipe...
        comme nous\_!"
      baseValue: Oh, look! Double trouble. A pair teaming up... just like us!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 15rTZw3b.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Je me demande qui est le cerveau...
      baseValue: I wonder which one is the brains...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: W48tqWIi.name
      type: 5
      value: "Gen\xE8se"
      baseValue: Genesis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.name
      type: 5
      value: Nilfheim
      baseValue: Nilfheim
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous vous pr\xE9cipitez vers le Prisme comme tous les conqu\xE9rants
        avant vous... aveugles \xE0 ce que vous ne comprenez pas."
      baseValue: You charge toward the Prism like all conquerors before you... blind
        to what you do not understand.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "D\xE9sol\xE9 pour le retard..."
      baseValue: Apologies for the delay...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.arrivalDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Une fois de plus sur la br\xE8che, tous les vaisseaux \xE0 l'attaque\_!"
      baseValue: Once more unto the breach, all ships engage!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.fleeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "On ne tiendra plus longtemps ensemble. Je me retire. Que tout \xE7a
        ne soit pas pour rien."
      baseValue: We won't hold together much longer. I'm pulling back. Don't let
        this be for nothing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Encore un ennemi vaincu. Bravo\_! Chargeons le portail du secteur."
      baseValue: Another enemy vanquished. Well done. Let's get that sector gateway
        charged.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: Il ne reste plus qu'un seul secteur entre nous et la Terre.
      baseValue: Only one more sector stands between us and Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Un secteur plein de plantes...
      baseValue: A sector full of plants...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: oPuSchCr.completeDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Des plantes\_? Ah oui, la flore... magnifique..."
      baseValue: Plants? Oh right, the Flora... lovely...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: LNahHPg9.name
      type: 5
      value: Tartarus
      baseValue: Tartarus
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: LNahHPg9.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Les secrets du Fant\xF4me sont d\xE9sormais n\xF4tres. Partez\u2026
        ou soyez enterr\xE9s avec eux."
      baseValue: The Phantom's secrets are ours now. Leave... or be buried with them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.name
      type: 5
      value: Vanaheimr
      baseValue: Vanaheimr
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: s6SdfeHC.arrivalDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Cette zone est soumise \xE0 une tension inhabituellement \xE9lev\xE9e..."
      baseValue: This area has an unusually high voltage about it...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.arrivalDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Et \xE7a veut dire quoi, exactement\_?"
      baseValue: And that means what, exactly?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: s6SdfeHC.arrivalDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: Si les boucliers tombent suffisamment longtemps, nous pourrons recharger
        ce vieux lecteur MP3.
      baseValue: If the shields drop long enough, we can recharge that old MP3 player.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: p4hMB2cf.name
      type: 5
      value: Point de navigation Alpha
      baseValue: Waypoint Alpha
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: i7YRZJJr.name
      type: 5
      value: Point de navigation Beta
      baseValue: Waypoint Beta
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: n6LzRSl6.name
      type: 5
      value: Point de navigation Gamma
      baseValue: Waypoint Gamma
      context: 
