        cible verrouill\xE9e."
      baseValue: Deploys heavy drones that will prioritize attacking your locked
        target.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: A2ZYwBqZ.name
      type: 19
      value: Kunai de brasier
      baseValue: Inferno Kunai
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: A2ZYwBqZ.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Vous permet de foncer vers l'avant en frappant d'un coup avec 2 armes
        parall\xE8les."
      baseValue: Allows you to lunge forward swiping with 2 parallel weapons.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: RkhZ6B2F.name
      type: 19
      value: "Pierres d'infinit\xE9"
      baseValue: Infinity Stones
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: RkhZ6B2F.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Une collection de puissantes pierres de r\xE9sistance."
      baseValue: A collection of powerful resistance stones.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: VkPuhm3l.name
      type: 19
      value: Irradiateur
      baseValue: Irradiator
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: VkPuhm3l.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Tire une dispersion d'\xE9clairs de plasma hautement radioactifs."
      baseValue: Shoots a spread of highly radioactive plasma bolts.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: uDCo1GTP.name
      type: 19
      value: "Lance l\xE9g\xE8re"
      baseValue: Light Lance
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: uDCo1GTP.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Accrochez-vous aux ennemis non prot\xE9g\xE9s et \xE0 d'autres objets.
        R\xE9clamez les \xE9toiles\_!"
      baseValue: Grapple on to unshielded enemies and other objects. Claim the Stars!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2Zugl0Vx.name
      type: 19
      value: Noisy Cricket
      baseValue: Noisy Cricket
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 2Zugl0Vx.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Une petite arme dot\xE9e d'une puissance de feu stup\xE9fiante."
      baseValue: A small weapon with an astonishing amount of firepower.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: A9P9ysE6.name
      type: 19
      value: "Propulseur suraliment\xE9"
      baseValue: Overcharge Thruster
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: A9P9ysE6.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Un propulseur \xE0 fus\xE9e qui a \xE9t\xE9 suraliment\xE9 pour de
        meilleures performances."
      baseValue: A rocket thruster that has been overcharged for higher performance.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SXi04921.name
      type: 19
      value: "\xC9metteur \xE0 prisme"
      baseValue: Prism Emitter
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: SXi04921.desc
      type: 8
      value: Tire un flux constant de plasma prismatique.
      baseValue: Shoots a constant stream of prismatic plasma.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: gDdDmjIU.name
      type: 19
      value: Rayon prismatique
      baseValue: Prism Ray
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: gDdDmjIU.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Un laser divisant la lumi\xE8re, \xE0 d\xE9g\xE2ts et port\xE9e \xE9lev\xE9s."
      baseValue: A high damage high range light splitting laser.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9IHUjM30.name
      type: 19
      value: Halo prismatique
      baseValue: Prismatic Halo
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9IHUjM30.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Un halo d'\xE9nergie entoure le vaisseau, infligeant des d\xE9g\xE2ts
        aux ennemis proches."
      baseValue: A halo of energy surrounds the ship damaging nearby enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0H29Pbza.name
      type: 19
      value: Lanceur d'orbes prismatiques
      baseValue: Prismatic Orb Launcher
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 0H29Pbza.desc
      type: 8
      value: Tire un orbe rotatif qui projette des projectiles plus petits.
      baseValue: Shoots a spinning orb that throws out smaller projectiles.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: zOyEuTIW.name
      type: 19
      value: Impulsion prismatique
      baseValue: Prismatic Pulse
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: zOyEuTIW.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Une explosion d'\xE9nergie prismatique qui frappe les ennemis proches."
      baseValue: A burst of prismatic energy that hits nearby enemies.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: zLrv8cWv.name
      type: 19
      value: Bouclier quantique
      baseValue: Quantum Shield
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: zLrv8cWv.desc
      type: 8
      value: Fournit un blindage en manipulant les particules subatomiques lors de
        l'impact.
      baseValue: Provides shielding by manipulating subatomic particles on impact.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7x3Y3esc.name
      type: 19
      value: Sentinelle PDL
      baseValue: Sentinel PDL
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7x3Y3esc.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Laser automatique qui tire des missiles, des drones et des ast\xE9ro\xEFdes."
      baseValue: Automatic laser that shoots missiles, drones and asteroids.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ZJCeMFES.name
      type: 19
      value: Balise Skeran Prime
      baseValue: Skeran Prime Beacon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: ZJCeMFES.desc
      type: 8
      value: Appelez des vaisseaux amis Skeran pour vous aider.
      baseValue: Call in friendly Skeran ships to assist you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: NHvULe78.name
      type: 19
      value: Lance solaire
      baseValue: Solar Lance
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: NHvULe78.desc
      type: 8
      value: Tire un laser thermique incroyablement chaud.
      baseValue: Fires an incredibly hot thermal damage laser.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
  - categoryName: Resource.MissionBase
    entries:
    - key: yMzJ40ae.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Arriv\xE9e ind\xE9sirable"
      baseValue: Unwelcome Arrival
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Les Species-XI sont arriv\xE9s dans le secteur."
      baseValue: Species-XI have arrived in the sector.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Zut\_! S'ils attaquent aussi loin, \xE7a veut dire que la Terre est
        d\xE9j\xE0 en danger. Nous devons rentrer et les pr\xE9venir."
      baseValue: Damn. If they're attacking this far out, it means Earth is already
        at risk. We need to get back and warn them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons r\xE9cup\xE9r\xE9 une de leurs graines infect\xE9es. Prenez-la,
        vous pourrez peut-\xEAtre en apprendre quelque chose."
      baseValue: We recovered one of their infected seeds. Take it, you might be
        able to learn something from it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "La graine infect\xE9e que vous transportez peut \xEAtre utilis\xE9e
        pour infecter un point de navigation."
      baseValue: The infected seed you carry can be used to infect a waypoint.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Cela semble \xEAtre une id\xE9e terrible..."
      baseValue: That sounds like a terrible idea...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yMzJ40ae.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Cela en invoquerait davantage, certes. Mais c'est seulement en les
        affrontant que vous apprendrez \xE0 les vaincre."
      baseValue: It would summon more of them, yes. But only by facing them will
        you learn to defeat them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Une mauvaise id\xE9e"
      baseValue: A Bad Idea
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Echo pense que vous pourriez utiliser la graine infect\xE9e pour infecter
        un point de navigation. Vous en trouverez au cours de votre voyage."
      baseValue: Echo thinks you could use the Infected Seed to infect a waypoint
        structure. You'll find them on your journey.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Un geste audacieux... L'Empereur voudra des r\xE9ponses si cela tourne
        mal."
      baseValue: A bold move... The Emperor will want answers if this goes wrong.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xnoUDvXJ.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Juste pour que ce soit clair, c'\xE9tait enti\xE8rement votre id\xE9e."
      baseValue: Just so we're clear, this was entirely your idea.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Activer le portail
      baseValue: Activate Gateway
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Activez le portail du secteur \xE0 Novus Prime."
      baseValue: Activate the Sector Gateway at Novus Prime.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Excellent, vous pouvez utiliser cette pierre angulaire dans le portail
        du secteur \xE0 Novus Prime."
      baseValue: Excellent, you can use that keystone in the sector gateway at Novus
        Prime.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Portail du secteur activ\xE9."
      baseValue: Sector gateway activated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Le portail du secteur est actif. Il perce \xE0 nouveau le vide... une
        technologie plus ancienne que la plupart de ceux qui vivent aujourd'hui,
        dont les secrets ont \xE9t\xE9 perdus au fil du temps."
      baseValue: The sector gateway is active. Once more piercing the void... technology
        older than most who now live, its secrets lost to time.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Le vide\_? C'est de l\xE0 que venaient les Species-XI..."
      baseValue: The void? That's where Species-XI came from...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "D'o\xF9 viennent bien des choses, et o\xF9 beaucoup se perdent. Les
        portails vous prot\xE9geront... leur lumi\xE8re brille d'un vif \xE9clat."
      baseValue: Where many things came from, and where many are lost. The gateways
        will shield you... its light burns bright.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Cela... n'est m\xEAme pas apparu sur nos capteurs."
      baseValue: That... didn't even show up on our sensors.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "On dirait qu'elle est d\xE9phas\xE9e par rapport \xE0 notre r\xE9alit\xE9.
        Elle doit venir du vide."
      baseValue: It's like she's out of phase with our reality. She must be from
        the void.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.2
      type: 2
      value: Pour l'instant, nos objectifs concordent. Nous sommes trop grands pour
        passer, mais si vous continuez, nous utiliserons votre signal pour trianguler
        votre position et vous suivre.
      baseValue: For now our objectives align. We're too large to fit through, but
        if you proceed, we'll use your signal to triangulate your position and follow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: yHMo6jar.dialog.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Bonne nouvelle\_: nous avons proc\xE9d\xE9 \xE0 la r\xE9tro-ing\xE9nierie
        des vaisseaux Skeran. Vous pouvez d\xE9sormais int\xE9grer leurs pi\xE8ces
        \xE0 votre concept."
      baseValue: Some good news, we have reverse-engineered the Skeran ships. You
        can now integrate their parts into your design.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Basilic
      baseValue: Basilisk
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Trouvez et d\xE9truisez le Basilic."
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Basilisk.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons localis\xE9 la deuxi\xE8me pierre angulaire. Elle est d\xE9tenue
        par le Basilic Skeran."
      baseValue: We've located the second keystone. It's held by the Skeran Basilisk.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2fY7bTi9.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "L'emplacement est indiqu\xE9 sur votre panneau de navigation. Approchez
        prudemment et assurez-vous d'\xEAtre pr\xEAt."
      baseValue: The location has been marked on your navigation panel. Approach
        carefully and ensure you're prepared.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8rT7W5Mz.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Behemoth
      baseValue: Behemoth
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 8rT7W5Mz.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Trouvez et d\xE9truisez le Behemoth."
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Behemoth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 8rT7W5Mz.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons localis\xE9 l'une des pierres angulaires et marqu\xE9 son
        emplacement dans votre panneau de navigation. R\xE9cup\xE9rez-la et ramenez-la
        ici."
      baseValue: We've tracked down one of the keystones and marked its location
        in your navigation panel. Retrieve it and bring it back here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "\xC9limination des d\xE9chets"
      baseValue: Junk Disposal
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.desc
      type: 8
      value: "D\xE9truisez le vaisseau Taureau d'\xE9lite utilis\xE9 par les Ferrailleurs."
      baseValue: Destroy the elite Bull ship used by the Junkers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous \xEAtes entr\xE9 en territoire Ferrailleur. D\xE9serteurs, pirates
        et pire encore."
      baseValue: You've entered Junker space. Deserters, pirates, and worse.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7ZURVAI0.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Leur vaisseau amiral est proche. D\xE9truisez-le, et nous briserons
        leur emprise sur cette ceinture. \xC0 vous de voir... mais les Ferrailleurs
        ne tombent pas facilement."
      baseValue: Their flagship is close. Destroy it, and we break their hold on
        this belt. Your call... but Junkers don't go down easy.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Citadelle
      baseValue: Citadel
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Le moment est venu de d\xE9truire la Citadelle."
      baseValue: Time has come to destroy the Citadel.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons localis\xE9 l'emplacement de la derni\xE8re pierre angulaire.
        Elle est conserv\xE9e dans la Citadelle Skeran\_!"
      baseValue: We've pinpointed the location of the final keystone. It's kept in
        the Skeran Citadel!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "La Citadelle est fortement fortifi\xE9e. C'est le c\u0153ur des op\xE9rations
        Skeran dans cette r\xE9gion\_; attendez-vous donc \xE0 une forte r\xE9sistance."
      baseValue: The Citadel is heavily fortified. It's the heart of Skeran operations
        in this region, so expect heavy resistance.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xytKXsHs.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "Je l'ai marqu\xE9e sur votre panneau de navigation. C'est la derni\xE8re
        \xE9tape pour activer compl\xE8tement le portail du secteur\_; assurez-vous
        d'\xEAtre pr\xEAt."
      baseValue: I've marked it on your navigation panel. This is the last step to
        fully activate the sector gateway, make sure you're prepared.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Bannis
      baseValue: Cast Out
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localisez et d\xE9truisez le Griffon d'\xE9lite utilis\xE9 par les
        Parias."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Griffin used by the Outcasts.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous entrez en territoire Paria. Leur abus des propulseurs temporels
        les a bris\xE9s. Soyez prudent."
      baseValue: You're entering Outcast territory. Their abuse of Temporal Drives
        has broken them. Tread carefully.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: PJaRqnUm.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: Leur vaisseau amiral est proche. Abattez-le, et leur emprise sur cette
        zone pourrait faiblir.
      baseValue: Their flagship is close. Take it down, and their grip here may falter.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Atteindre Novus Prime
      baseValue: Reach Novus Prime
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Escortez la flotte jusqu'\xE0 Novus Prime."
      baseValue: Escort the fleet to Novus Prime.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Excellent travail. C'\xE9tait juste\u2026 trop juste. Je doute que
        quiconque d'autre aurait pu nous en sortir."
      baseValue: Excellent work. That was close... too close. I doubt anyone else
        could've got us out of that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Nous devons retourner sur Terre imm\xE9diatement et avertir l'Empereur
        de ce nouvel ennemi."
      baseValue: We need to return to Earth immediately and warn the Emperor about
        this new enemy.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xC9trange. Les syst\xE8mes d'hyperpropulsion sont op\xE9rationnels,
        mais... nous ne pouvons pas tracer une route directe vers la Terre."
      baseValue: Strange. Hyperdrive systems are operational, but... we can't plot
        a direct course back to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "Quoi\_? Pourquoi pas\_?"
      baseValue: What? Why not?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.4
      type: 2
      value: "Inconnu. Les donn\xE9es de navigation semblent... corrompues."
      baseValue: Unknown. Navigation data appears... corrupted.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.5
      type: 2
      value: "C'est un probl\xE8me grave. L'ennemi pourrait-il en \xEAtre responsable\_?"
      baseValue: That's a serious problem. Could the enemy be responsible?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.6
      type: 2
      value: L'ennemi s'appelle Species-XI.
      baseValue: The enemy are called Species-XI.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.7
      type: 2
      value: "Comment le savez-vous\_?"
      baseValue: How do you know that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.8
      type: 2
      value: "Une \xE9trange entit\xE9 blanche brillante nous a dit..."
      baseValue: A strange glowing white entity told us...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.9
      type: 2
      value: Je vois... Ce n'est pas vraiment rassurant.
      baseValue: I see... That's not exactly reassuring.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.10
      type: 2
      value: "Elle a \xE9galement dit qu'elle avait laiss\xE9 ce vaisseau pour nous."
      baseValue: She also said she left this ship for us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.11
      type: 2
      value: "C'est not\xE9. Pour l'instant, dirigez-vous vers le portail du secteur
        \xE0 Novus Prime. Nous en parlerons plus en d\xE9tail l\xE0-bas."
      baseValue: Noted. For now, head toward the sector gateway at Novus Prime. We'll
        talk more there.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.0.12
      type: 2
      value: "Avant de partir, vous avez une r\xE9compense de mission \xE0 r\xE9cup\xE9rer.
        Les priorit\xE9s, apr\xE8s tout."
      baseValue: Before we leave, you have a mission reward to collect. Priorities,
        after all.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Tr\xE8s bien, sortons d'ici avant que d'autres cr\xE9atures \xE9tranges
        n'apparaissent."
      baseValue: All right, let's get out of here before more strange creatures appear.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Oh, regardez \xE7a, des locaux sympathiques\_!"
      baseValue: Oh, look at that, some friendly locals!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Abandonnez votre vaisseau, ou mourez\_!"
      baseValue: Surrender your ship, or die!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Correction\_: pas amical. Certainement pas amical."
      baseValue: 'Correction: not friendly. Definitely not friendly.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "De toute \xE9vidence, ces vaisseaux ne b\xE9n\xE9ficiaient pas d'une
        IA de combat avanc\xE9e."
      baseValue: Clearly, those ships didn't have the benefit of advanced combat
        AI.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Passons \xE0 Novus Prime avant que d'autres n'apparaissent."
      baseValue: Let's move on to Novus Prime before more of them show up.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.4.0
      type: 2
      value: "Bravo de nous avoir conduits ici. Voici le portail du secteur\_; nous
        allons \xE9tablir notre camp et tenir la position."
      baseValue: Great work leading us here. This is the sector gateway, we'll establish
        camp and hold the position.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.4.1
      type: 2
      value: "Amarrez-vous au vaisseau-m\xE8re. Nous avons encore des choses \xE0
        discuter."
      baseValue: Dock with the mothership. We've got more to discuss.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous pouvez acheter et vendre des objets ici, ainsi que r\xE9parer,
        am\xE9liorer et reconcevoir votre vaisseau."
      baseValue: You can buy and sell items here as well as repair, upgrade, and
        redesign your ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.1
      type: 2
      value: Ce portail du secteur nous rapprochera un peu plus de la Terre.
      baseValue: This sector gateway will take us one step closer to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.2
      type: 2
      value: "Les forces Skeran dans ce secteur d\xE9tiennent cependant les trois
        pierres angulaires n\xE9cessaires \xE0 son alimentation."
      baseValue: The Skeran forces in this sector hold the three keystones needed
        to power it though.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.3
      type: 2
      value: "Je vais commencer \xE0 les traquer. En attendant, j'ai une autre t\xE2che
        pour vous. Quand vous vous d\xE9tacherez, je mettrai \xE0 jour votre navigation."
      baseValue: I'll start tracking them down. In the meantime, I have another task
        for you. When you undock I'll update your navigation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: o3RTFjfM.dialog.5.4
      type: 2
      value: "Vous devriez modifier le concept de votre vaisseau avant le d\xE9samarrage.
        Je ne voudrais pas que quelqu'un le prenne pour un d\xE9bris spatial."
      baseValue: You should edit the ship's design before undocking. Wouldn't want
        someone to mistake it for space junk.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Sauver l'Assembleur
      baseValue: Rescue the Assembler
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.desc
      type: 8
      value: "L'ing\xE9nieur Relios a d\xE9vi\xE9 de sa route. Trouvez-le et sauvez
        son vaisseau."
      baseValue: Engineer Relios has strayed off course. Find him and rescue his
        ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Bien\_! Relios pilotait l'Assembleur, mais son signal de transpondeur
        est \xE0 bonne distance."
      baseValue: Right! Relios was flying the Assembler but his transponder signal
        is some distance away.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Il a d\xFB d\xE9vier de sa route. Retrouvez-le et ramenez-le ici."
      baseValue: He must have gone off course. Track him down and bring him back
        here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Bon travail\_! L'assembleur est de retour parmi nous."
      baseValue: Good work! That's the Assembler back with us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: OLwSwMjt.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Ouais, merci pour le sauvetage\_! Si vous revenez vous amarrer \xE0
        l'Assembleur, je peux am\xE9liorer le niveau de votre \xE9quipement\_!"
      baseValue: Aye, thanks for the save! If you come back and dock with the Assembler
        I can boost the level of equipment for ya!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Voyager vers le Secteur 2
      baseValue: Travel to Sector 2
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.desc
      type: 8
      value: Traversez le portail vers le Secteur 2.
      baseValue: Travel through the gateway to Sector 2.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Cet endroit semble froid... Enfin, je ne le sens pas vraiment, mais
        les relev\xE9s de temp\xE9rature sont abyssalement bas."
      baseValue: This place feels cold... Well, I can't actually feel, but the temperature
        readings are abysmally low.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "L'espace n'est-il pas toujours froid\_?"
      baseValue: Isn't all space cold?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Plus froid. Tout est relatif, vous vous souvenez\_?"
      baseValue: Cold-er. Everything's relative, remember?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9zjbfvq0.dialog.1.3
      type: 2
      value: Voici le vieux bonhomme...
      baseValue: Here comes the old guy...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Activer le portail
      baseValue: Activate Gateway
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Activez le portail du secteur \xE0 Genesis."
      baseValue: Activate the Sector Gateway at Genesis.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons atteint le portail du secteur, mais il est \xE0 nouveau
        hors ligne. Les Fant\xF4mes contr\xF4lent les pierres angulaires de celui-ci."
      baseValue: We've reached the sector gateway, but it's offline again. The Phantoms
        control the keystones for this one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons d\xE9j\xE0 commenc\xE9 \xE0 les localiser. Restez vigilant,
        ce ne sera pas facile."
      baseValue: We've already begun tracking down their locations. Stay sharp, this
        won't be easy.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Portail du secteur activ\xE9."
      baseValue: Sector gateway activated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Vous connaissez la proc\xE9dure, passez \xE0 travers et nous triangulerons
        votre position."
      baseValue: You know the drill, jump through and we'll triangulate on you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Les vaisseaux Phantom ont aussi \xE9t\xE9 r\xE9trocon\xE7us\_! Vous
        pouvez d\xE9sormais utiliser leurs pi\xE8ces dans votre concept."
      baseValue: That's the Phantom ships reverse-engineered as well! You can now
        use their parts in your design.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Je ne m'attendais pas \xE0 vous voir aux c\xF4t\xE9s du Prisme de Cristal..."
      baseValue: Didn't expect to see you along side the Crystal Prism...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Chaque pi\xE8ce sur l'\xE9chiquier bouge pour une raison."
      baseValue: Every piece on the board moves for a reason.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Et de quel c\xF4t\xE9 jouez-vous\_?"
      baseValue: And which side are you playing?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: EqV0ybrf.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: Les camps sont pour ceux qui ne peuvent pas voir l'ensemble de la partie.
      baseValue: Sides are for those who can't see the whole game.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YXJO8vCK.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Baldur et Hodr
      baseValue: Baldur and Hodr
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YXJO8vCK.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Trouvez et d\xE9truisez Baldur et Hodr."
      baseValue: Find and destroy Baldur and Hodr.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: YXJO8vCK.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "La deuxi\xE8me pierre angulaire est gard\xE9e par Baldur et un vaisseau
        du Panth\xE9on, Hodr. Nous devrons les d\xE9truire tous les deux pour la
        s\xE9curiser."
      baseValue: The second keystone is guarded by Baldur and a Pantheon vessel,
        Hodr. We'll need to destroy them both to secure it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Gu\xE9rir le fl\xE9au"
      baseValue: Cure The Blight
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localisez et d\xE9truisez le Blight d'\xE9lite utilis\xE9 par l'Ombre."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Blight used by the Shadow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Un vaisseau amiral Ombre se cache ici, il a infiltr\xE9 l'espace Fant\xF4me."
      baseValue: There's a Shadow flagship hiding here that's infiltrated Phantom
        space.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: O2u7t0qu.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "L'\xE9liminer affaiblirait leur pr\xE9sence... mais la d\xE9cision
        vous appartient."
      baseValue: Taking it out would weaken their presence... but the decision is
        yours.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2ZYy45v0.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Prisme de Cristal
      baseValue: Crystal Prism
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2ZYy45v0.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Le moment est venu de d\xE9truire le Prisme de Cristal."
      baseValue: Time has come to destroy the Crystal Prism.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 2ZYy45v0.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Le Prisme de Cristal est un centre de pouvoir dans ce secteur. Il d\xE9tient
        la derni\xE8re pierre angulaire dont nous avons besoin."
      baseValue: The Crystal Prism is a nexus of power in this sector. It holds the
        final keystone we need.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Horizon des \xC9v\xE9nements"
      baseValue: Event Horizon
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localisez et d\xE9truisez l'Horizon d'\xE9lite utilis\xE9 par le Panth\xE9on."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Horizon used by the Pantheon.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Le vaisseau du Panth\xE9on, Horizon, est devant. Ils ont quitt\xE9
        le Conclave en qu\xEAte d'id\xE9aux\u2026 et non par go\xFBt du chaos."
      baseValue: The Pantheon vessel Horizon is ahead. They broke from the Conclave
        chasing ideals... not chaos.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: Ir9Fq2E1.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Les id\xE9aux n'excusent pas la trahison. L'Empereur l'a clairement
        \xE9tabli. Engagez le combat s'il le faut."
      baseValue: Ideals don't excuse treason. The Emperor made that clear. Engage
        if you must.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: nu9Z8AUg.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      baseValue: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: nu9Z8AUg.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Trouvez et d\xE9truisez Mj\xF6lnir."
      baseValue: "Find and destroy Mj\xF6lnir."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: nu9Z8AUg.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Capt\xE9 une \xE9norme surtension\u2026 assez puissante pour griller
        une flotte. Il s'av\xE8re qu'elle vient d'un vaisseau nomm\xE9 Mj\xF6lnir.
        Je parie une bi\xE8re que c'est l\xE0 que se trouve la pierre angulaire."
      baseValue: "Picked up a massive power surge... strong enough to fry a fleet.
        Turns out, it's comin' from a ship called Mj\xF6lnir. Bet ya a pint that's
        where the keystone is."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Voyager vers Genesis
      baseValue: Travel to Genesis
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localisez le prochain portail du secteur \xE0 Genesis."
      baseValue: Locate the next sector gateway at Genesis.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Je pensais vous accompagner cette fois\u2026 histoire de m'assurer
        que vous ne vous perdiez pas. On ne peut pas vous laisser d\xE9river vers
        un caillou gel\xE9, n'est-ce pas\_?"
      baseValue: Thought I'd tag along this time... make sure ya don't get lost.
        Can't have ya driftin' off into some frozen rock, now can we?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: Excellent. Cela fera gagner du temps lors de la mission de sauvetage.
      baseValue: Excellent. That'll save time on the rescue mission.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "Les Fant\xF4mes n'appr\xE9cieront pas notre pr\xE9sence. Mais c'est
        un pas de plus vers la Terre."
      baseValue: Phantoms won't take kindly to our presence. But it's one step closer
        to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "Notre prochain objectif est le portail du secteur \xE0 Genesis."
      baseValue: Our next objective is the sector gateway at Genesis.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.4
      type: 2
      value: "Bien s\xFBr, ce ne sera pas aussi simple que d'arriver sur place."
      baseValue: Of course, it won't be as simple as just showing up.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 4A6TXCsb.dialog.0.5
      type: 2
      value: Ce n'est jamais le cas...
      baseValue: It never is...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Voyager vers le Secteur 3
      baseValue: Travel to Sector 3
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.desc
      type: 8
      value: Traversez le portail vers le Secteur 3.
      baseValue: Travel through the gateway to Sector 3.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Secteur 3... o\xF9 m\xEAme les plantes veulent nous tuer."
      baseValue: Sector 3... where even the plants want to kill us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "La Flora\_? Je ne les ai jamais rencontr\xE9s."
      baseValue: The Flora? I've not met them before.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hj40rVq9.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ils nous voient comme des destructeurs corrompus de la nature. Ce qui,
        pour \xEAtre honn\xEAte\u2026 est en grande partie vrai. Mais aussi grossier."
      baseValue: They see us as corrupt destroyers of nature. Which, to be fair...
        is mostly accurate. But also, rude.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Activer le portail
      baseValue: Activate Gateway
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Activez le portail du secteur \xE0 Eden."
      baseValue: Activate the Sector Gateway at Eden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nous sommes suffisamment proches du Secteur 4 pour que je puisse peut-\xEAtre
        percer les interf\xE9rences. Si le Grand Mar\xE9chal est toujours en vie,
        je le saurai bien assez t\xF4t."
      baseValue: We're close enough to Sector 4 now that I might be able to break
        through the interference. If the Grand Marshal's still alive, I'll find out
        soon enough.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "En attendant, vous connaissez la marche \xE0 suivre. Ce portail ne
        s'ouvrira pas tout seul. Rep\xE9rez les pierres angulaires et nous pourrons
        enfin faire le saut vers la maison."
      baseValue: Meanwhile, you know the drill. That gateway isn't going to open
        itself. Track down the keystones, and we can finally make the jump home.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Portail du secteur activ\xE9. Les coordonn\xE9es de notre retour sur
        Terre sont verrouill\xE9es."
      baseValue: Sector gateway activated. Coordinates are locked for our return
        to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Je prendrais bien un whisky ou deux avant d'affronter le Grand Mar\xE9chal
        Vex en personne. Peut-\xEAtre trois."
      baseValue: I'd grab a whisky or two before facing Grand Marshal Vex in person.
        Maybe three.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Attention. Il n'est pas du genre \xE0 appr\xE9cier votre\u2026 charme."
      baseValue: Careful. He's not the sort to appreciate your... charm.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Bon, advienne que pourra. La Terre, Vex, et ce qui reste de la f\xEAte
        de bienvenue."
      baseValue: Well, here goes nothing. Earth, Vex, and whatever's left of the
        welcome party.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Essayez de sourire. Il pourrait vous promouvoir\u2026 ou vous an\xE9antir.
        Dans tous les cas, m\xE9morable."
      baseValue: Try to smile. He might promote you... or vaporize you. Either way,
        memorable.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Les composants que j'ai revendiqu\xE9s formeront le noyau de quelque
        chose de plus grand."
      baseValue: The components I claimed will form the core of something greater.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Oh, qu'est-ce que c'est\_?"
      baseValue: Oh, what's that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Une arme. Con\xE7ue pour r\xE9duire le vide au silence."
      baseValue: A weapon. One designed to silence the void.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: Et maintenant... nous la construisons ensemble.
      baseValue: And now... we build it together.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Pourquoi cela ressemblait-il moins \xE0 un cadeau qu'\xE0 un ultimatum
        voil\xE9\_?"
      baseValue: Why did that feel less like a gift and more like a veiled ultimatum?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 3FNBikT3.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: J'en ai assez d'essayer de la comprendre. Allons sur Terre, et nous
        nous en occuperons.
      baseValue: I'm done trying to figure her out. Let's get to Earth then we'll
        deal with it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Sanguinaire
      baseValue: Bloodroot
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Trouvez et d\xE9truisez la Sanguinaire."
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Bloodroot.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons localis\xE9 la deuxi\xE8me pierre angulaire. Elle est encastr\xE9e
        dans un immense vaisseau de la Flora aux vignes tordues et aux feuilles rouges
        br\xFBlantes. \xC9liminez-le et r\xE9cup\xE9rez la pierre angulaire."
      baseValue: We've located the second keystone. It's embedded in a massive Flora
        vessel twisted vines, burning red leaves. Eliminate it and retrieve the keystone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous voyez\_? M\xEAme les gardiens de la vie peuvent saigner. Les racines
        de cette galaxie pourrissent\u2026 et vous \xEAtes le feu dont elle a besoin."
      baseValue: You see? Even the guardians of life can bleed. The roots of this
        galaxy are rotting... and you're the fire it needs.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: J'ai fait ce que je devais faire. La flotte a besoin de cette pierre
        angulaire.
      baseValue: I did what I had to. The fleet needs that keystone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: qSzuRLOd.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Bien s\xFBr. Ordres donn\xE9s, ordres ex\xE9cut\xE9s. Une arme si fiable\u2026"
      baseValue: Of course. Orders given, orders followed. Such a reliable weapon...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Menez-moi \xE0 votre chef"
      baseValue: Take Me to Your Leader
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localisez et d\xE9truisez le Cortex d'\xE9lite utilis\xE9 par les Gris."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Cortex used by the Grays.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Alors\u2026 c'est l\xE0 qu'ils se cachent. On est loin de Mars\u2026"
      baseValue: So... this is where they've been hiding. We're a long way from Mars...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Oui, et apparemment, il est bien enfoui. Il y a un Cortex cach\xE9
        l\xE0-dedans."
      baseValue: Aye, and dug in deep from the looks of it. There's a Cortex hiding
        in there.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: xmIJl5mO.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "Leur vaisseau amiral est la source de tout \xE7a. Si on l'\xE9limine,
        on coupe leur acc\xE8s."
      baseValue: That flagship of theirs is the root of it. Take it out, and we cut
        off their reach.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "La v\xE9rit\xE9 est ailleurs"
      baseValue: The Truth is Out There
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.desc
      type: 8
      value: "D\xE9truisez la sonde ennemie qui vous suit."
      baseValue: Destroy the enemy probe that has been following you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Eh bien, regardez-moi \xE7a\u2026 une \xE9trange sonde a d\xE9cid\xE9
        de nous suivre. Les scans indiquent qu'elle est plus coriace qu'il n'y para\xEEt."
      baseValue: Well, look at that... some weird probe decided to tail us. Scans
        indicate it's tougher than it looks.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: CVX5BqH7.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Une Cl\xE9 de portail. Je suppose que cela ouvrira le portail verrouill\xE9
        que nous avons trouv\xE9 plus t\xF4t."
      baseValue: A Gateway Cipher. Guessing that'll open that locked gateway we found
        earlier.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 920RNPlS.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Lumenveil
      baseValue: Lumenveil
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 920RNPlS.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Trouvez et d\xE9truisez le Lumenveil."
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Lumenveil.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 920RNPlS.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "J'ai capt\xE9 une lueur visible d'ici. Le vaisseau s'appelle Lumenveil.
        Je suis quasi s\xFBr que cet \xE9clat cache une pierre angulaire."
      baseValue: Picked up a glow you could see from here. Ship's called Lumenveil.
        Pretty sure that sparkle's hiding a keystone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Voyager vers Eden
      baseValue: Travel to Eden
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localisez le prochain portail du secteur \xE0 Eden."
      baseValue: Locate the next sector gateway at Eden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous savez, Gid... apr\xE8s tout \xE7a, je pense que je pourrais prendre
        ma retraite, m'installer quelque part, peut-\xEAtre faire un jardin."
      baseValue: You know, Gid... after all this, I'm thinkin' I might retire, settle
        down somewhere, maybe start a garden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: Je ne vous voyais pas en jardinier.
      baseValue: Didn't take you for the gardening type.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "Jardiner, c'est pas si dur, hein\_? Tant que les plantes ne sont pas
        arm\xE9es."
      baseValue: How hard can gardening be, eh? Long as the plants ain't armed.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: U2Dy7ZWm.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "Dans ce secteur\u2026 c'est peut-\xEAtre trop demander. Nous sommes
        \xE0 un saut du portail du secteur \xE0 Eden, en route\_!"
      baseValue: In this sector... that might be too much to ask. We're just one
        jump away from the Sector gateway at Eden, let's go!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Voyager vers le Secteur 4
      baseValue: Travel to Sector 4
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.desc
      type: 8
      value: Traversez le portail vers le Secteur 4.
      baseValue: Travel through the gateway to Sector 4.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: Amiral Gideon. Rapport.
      baseValue: Admiral Gideon. Report.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: Nous sommes de retour et nous ne sommes pas seuls.
      baseValue: We made it back and we are not alone.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Je sais. La cr\xE9ature est arriv\xE9e la premi\xE8re et est d\xE9j\xE0
        \xE0 l'\u0153uvre."
      baseValue: I know. The creature arrived first and is already at work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Elle l'a qualifi\xE9e d'arme et affirme qu'elle \xAB fera taire le
        vide \xBB."
      baseValue: She called it a weapon and says it will "silence the void".
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Elle \xE9vite de donner des d\xE9tails."
      baseValue: She avoids specifics.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.5
      type: 2
      value: "L'Empereur m'a donn\xE9 pleins pouvoirs pour d\xE9fendre la Terre.
        Je prendrai toutes les armes \xE0 ma disposition."
      baseValue: The Emperor has given me full authority to defend Earth. I will
        take any weapon I can use.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.6
      type: 2
      value: "Une flotte Skeran vient de franchir la bordure ext\xE9rieure."
      baseValue: A Skeran fleet just breached the outer rim.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.7
      type: 2
      value: "Ouais... on a d\xE9truit leur Citadelle au passage."
      baseValue: Yeah... we destroyed their Citadel on the way through.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.2.8
      type: 2
      value: Nous allons nous en occuper.
      baseValue: We'll deal with them.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Votre peuple s'est-il d\xE9j\xE0 demand\xE9 pourquoi les portails de
        votre secteur d'origine convergent vers votre plan\xE8te\_?"
      baseValue: Did your race ever wonder why the gateways in your home sector converge
        on your planet?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Les Architectes\_?"
      baseValue: The Architects?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "Exactement. Les Architectes ont fa\xE7onn\xE9 ce secteur autour de
        leur foyer, pas du v\xF4tre."
      baseValue: Exactly. The Architects shaped this sector around their home, not
        yours.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Vous avez h\xE9rit\xE9 de leur monde, de leur technologie et de leurs
        p\xE9ch\xE9s."
      baseValue: You inherited their world, their technology, and their sins.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: hZxaCpBL.dialog.3.4
      type: 2
      value: "Je vais terminer ce qu'ils ont commenc\xE9. Tenez le secteur jusqu'\xE0
        ce que l'arme soit achev\xE9e."
      baseValue: I will finish what they started. Hold the sector until the weapon
        is complete.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Verdiction
      baseValue: Verdiction
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: C45cHN24.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Le moment est venu de d\xE9truire le Verdiction."
      baseValue: Time has come to destroy the Verdiction.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons localis\xE9 le Verdiction, le vaisseau amiral de la Flora."
      baseValue: We've pinpointed the Verdiction. The Flora's capital ship.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "C'est donc le pilote dont vous avez parl\xE9."
      baseValue: So this is the pilot you mentioned.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.2
      type: 2
      value: "Pas le temps pour les plaisanteries. D\xE9truisez le Verdiction. Puis
        retournez imm\xE9diatement sur Terre."
      baseValue: No time for pleasantries. Destroy the Verdiction. Then return to
        Earth immediately.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.0.3
      type: 2
      value: "Hein. Et moi qui pensais que c'\xE9tait moi \xE0 qui il manquait des
        unit\xE9s \xE9motionnelles."
      baseValue: Huh. And here I thought I was the one missing emotional units.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: Le Verdiction n'est plus. Acceptable.
      baseValue: The Verdiction is gone. Acceptable.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: Vous avez accompli votre mission. Terminez-la. Activez le portail et
        retournez sur Terre.
      baseValue: You've done your part. Now finish it. Activate the gateway and return
        to Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: C45cHN24.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Bien s\xFBr. Peut-\xEAtre que la m\xE9daille viendra plus tard\u2026
        ou quelque chose comme \xE7a."
      baseValue: Sure. Maybe the medal comes later... or something.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Lumi\xE8re aveuglante"
      baseValue: Blinding Light
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Localisez et d\xE9truisez la Vibrance d'\xC9lite utilis\xE9e par les
        Oubli\xE9s."
      baseValue: Locate and destroy the Elite Vibrance used by the Forgotten.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "La faction Oubli\xE9e est dirig\xE9e par un vaisseau amiral appel\xE9
        Vibrance."
      baseValue: The Forgotten faction is led by a flagship called Vibrance.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: soTbMBtP.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: "Le d\xE9truire mettrait fin \xE0 leur croisade."
      baseValue: Destroying it would end their crusade.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "D\xE9fendre la Terre"
      baseValue: Defend Earth
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.desc
      type: 8
      value: "D\xE9truisez les deux vaisseaux capitaux attaquants."
      baseValue: Destroy both attacking capital ships.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "T\xE2che accomplie. Retour \xE0 la flotte."
      baseValue: Task complete. Return to the fleet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.0.1
      type: 2
      value: Toujours aussi inspirant...
      baseValue: Inspirational as always...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "La \xAB\_cr\xE9ature\_\xBB indique que le dispositif peut maintenant
        \xEAtre activ\xE9."
      baseValue: The "creature" indicates the device can now be activated.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Lui faites-vous confiance\_?"
      baseValue: Do you trust it?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: HBUsS3vN.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nous n'avons pas le choix. Tous les vaisseaux, pr\xE9parez-vous \xE0
        l'activation..."
      baseValue: We don't have a choice. All ships, prepare for activation...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "L\xE9viathan"
      baseValue: Leviathan
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Trouvez et d\xE9truisez le L\xE9viathan."
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Leviathan.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "Un vaisseau de classe L\xE9viathan des Species-XI se dirige \xE9galement
        vers la Terre. Interceptez-le et d\xE9truisez-le avant son arriv\xE9e."
      baseValue: A Leviathan-class Species-XI vessel is also inbound for Earth. Intercept
        and destroy it before it arrives.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 9PUUF16Y.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Le L\xE9viathan est tomb\xE9... vous avez fait honneur \xE0 la flotte."
      baseValue: The Leviathan has fallen... you've done the fleet proud.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: rOWbIQCL.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Zyraxx
      baseValue: Zyraxx
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: rOWbIQCL.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Trouvez et d\xE9truisez le Zyraxx."
      baseValue: Find and destroy the Zyraxx.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: rOWbIQCL.dialog.0.0
      type: 2
      value: "La flotte de l'Ombre est men\xE9e par un vaisseau nomm\xE9 le Zyraxx.
        Traquez-le."
      baseValue: The Shadow fleet is led by a vessel known as the Zyraxx. Hunt it
        down.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: rOWbIQCL.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Ha\_! Vous avez compl\xE8tement d\xE9mantel\xE9 cette chose... beau
        travail\_!"
      baseValue: Ha! Ye tore that thing apart... fine work!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.displayName
      type: 5
      value: Didacticiel
      baseValue: Tutorial
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Apprenez \xE0 contr\xF4ler votre vaisseau en attendant la flotte."
      baseValue: Learn to control your ship while waiting for the fleet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Attention\_: d\xE9faillance des syst\xE8mes de survie. Une action imm\xE9diate
        est requise."
      baseValue: 'Warning: life support systems failing. Immediate action required.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Pourquoi quelqu'un laisserait-il un vaisseau ici\_? \xC7a n'a aucun
        sens."
      baseValue: Why would someone leave a ship out here? This doesn't make any sense.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Inconnu. La priorit\xE9 est la survie. Nous devons nous transf\xE9rer
        imm\xE9diatement."
      baseValue: Unknown. Priority is survival. We must transfer immediately.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Transfert syst\xE8me termin\xE9. Limite de stockage syst\xE8me d\xE9pass\xE9e."
      baseValue: System transfer complete. System storage limit exceeded.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Fantastique. Ce vaisseau a encore moins de m\xE9moire que le pr\xE9c\xE9dent.
        Qui construit ces trucs\_?"
      baseValue: Fantastic. This ship has even less memory than the last one. Who
        builds these things?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.6
      type: 2
      value: "Je peux vous retransf\xE9rer si vous voulez..."
      baseValue: I can transfer you back if you want...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.8
      type: 2
      value: Ou non...
      baseValue: Or not...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.9
      type: 2
      value: "J'ai d\xFB supprimer certaines de mes unit\xE9s \xE9motionnelles, la
        compassion, la patience, vous savez, les choses triviales. Heureusement,
        je surpasse toujours largement votre intellect."
      baseValue: I had to delete some of my emotional units, compassion, patience,
        you know, the trivial stuff. Thankfully, I still far exceed your intellect.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.10
      type: 2
      value: Oh, quelle chance j'ai.
      baseValue: Oh, lucky me.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.12
      type: 2
      value: "Choisissez votre sch\xE9ma de contr\xF4le. Essayez de ne rien casser."
      baseValue: Pick your control scheme. Try not to break anything.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.1.14
      type: 2
      value: Vous pouvez changer cela plus tard si vous le souhaitez.
      baseValue: You can change that later if you want.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "H\xE9, \xE0 quoi sert ce sous-syst\xE8me\_?"
      baseValue: Hey, what's this subsystem for?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Cargaison d\xE9tect\xE9e \xE0 l'ext\xE9rieur du vaisseau. Activez le
        rayon tracteur pour la r\xE9cup\xE9rer."
      baseValue: Cargo detected outside the ship. Activate the tractor beam to retrieve
        it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Tu l'as \xE9ject\xE9, n'est-ce pas\_?"
      baseValue: You ejected it, didn't you?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "L'\xE9jection a eu lieu, mais l'attention doit rester concentr\xE9e
        sur la r\xE9cup\xE9ration. Activez le rayon tracteur."
      baseValue: Ejection occurred, but the focus should remain on retrieval. Activate
        the tractor beam.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.2.5
      type: 2
      value: Bien. Ce n'est absolument pas ta faute, alors.
      baseValue: Right. Totally not your fault, then.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous pouvez activer \xAB Rayon tracteur automatique \xBB dans les param\xE8tres
        si vous le souhaitez."
      baseValue: You can enable 'Automatic Tractor Beam' in the settings if you wish.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Heureusement que ce vaisseau dispose d'un si\xE8ge \xE9jectable manuel."
      baseValue: Glad this ship has a manual ejector seat.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "En parlant de syst\xE8mes manuels primitifs, voyons si vous pouvez
        piloter cet engin."
      baseValue: Speaking of primitive manual systems. Let's see if you can fly this
        thing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.4.0
      type: 2
      value: Cet engin dispose aussi de propulseurs d'esquive.
      baseValue: This thing also has dodge thrusters.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "Ouiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii\_!"
      baseValue: Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.1
      type: 2
      value: Utilisez le gros bouton rouge pour activer les propulseurs de boost.
      baseValue: Use the big red button to activate the boost thrusters.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.2
      type: 2
      value: "Quel gros bouton rouge\_?"
      baseValue: What big red button?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.3
      type: 2
      value: "C'\xE9tait une m\xE9taphore. Vous devez s\xFBrement les conna\xEEtre\_?"
      baseValue: That was a metaphor. Surely you're familiar with those?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.4
      type: 2
      value: "Vous avez supprim\xE9 la compassion mais gard\xE9 les m\xE9taphores\_?"
      baseValue: You deleted compassion but kept metaphors?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.5.5
      type: 2
      value: "Et sept livres audio, quelques s\xE9ries t\xE9l\xE9 et une recette
        de fajitas. Vous me remercierez si \xE7a ne marche pas."
      baseValue: And seven audiobooks, a few TV series, and a recipe for Fajitas.
        You'll thank me if this doesn't work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.6.0
      type: 2
      value: "Excellent. Cela devrait \xEAtre utile, m\xEAme si j'ai entendu dire
        que les habitants d'ici sont plut\xF4t sympathiques."
      baseValue: Excellent. That should come in handy, although I hear the locals
        here are quite friendly.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.6.1
      type: 2
      value: "En parlant de cela, j'activerai l'affichage t\xEAte haute pour que
        vous puissiez voir ce qui arrive."
      baseValue: Speaking of which, I'll enable the heads-up display so you can see
        what's coming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.7.0
      type: 2
      value: "Il faudra un certain temps \xE0 la flotte pour trianguler cette position."
      baseValue: It'll take some time for the fleet to triangulate this position.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.7.1
      type: 2
      value: "En attendant, voyons si vous pouvez comprendre les syst\xE8mes d'armement.
        Essayez de ne pas vous tirer dessus."
      baseValue: While we wait, let's see if you can figure out the weapon systems.
        Try not to shoot yourself.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.8.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous pouvez \xE9galement viser les tourelles pour tirer derri\xE8re
        vous. Id\xE9al pour une retraite tactique\u2026 comme un l\xE2che."
      baseValue: You can also aim the turrets to shoot behind you. Perfect for when
        you're making a tactical retreat... like a coward.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.9.0
      type: 2
      value: "Maintenant, \xE9quipez-vous de l'arme que nous avons \xE9ject\xE9e
        plus t\xF4t."
      baseValue: Now, equip the weapon we ejected earlier.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.9.1
      type: 2
      value: "Nous\_?"
      baseValue: We?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.9.2
      type: 2
      value: "Bien s\xFBr\_! Nous formons une \xE9quipe, les cerveaux et les muscles."
      baseValue: Of course! We're a team, the brains and the brawn.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.10.0
      type: 2
      value: "Excellent. Heureusement que nous l'avons conserv\xE9."
      baseValue: Excellent. Good thing we held onto that.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.11.0
      type: 2
      value: "Maintenant, tirez sur quelques-uns de ces ast\xE9ro\xEFdes \xE0 proximit\xE9.
        Soyons honn\xEAtes\u2026 vous avez besoin d'entra\xEEnement."
      baseValue: Now, shoot some of those nearby asteroids. Let's face it... you
        need the practice.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.12.0
      type: 2
      value: "\xC7a fera l'affaire\u2026 je suppose. Essayez de ne pas nous faire
        tuer."
      baseValue: That'll have to do... I suppose. Try not to get us killed.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.0
      type: 2
      value: "Curieux. Vous avez plus de combativit\xE9 que je ne l'aurais cru."
      baseValue: Curious. You have more fight in you than I expected.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.1
      type: 2
      value: "Qui... qu'\xEAtes-vous\_?"
      baseValue: Who... what are you?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.2
      type: 2
      value: "Un guide, peut-\xEAtre. Appelez-moi \xC9cho."
      baseValue: A guide, perhaps. You may call me Echo.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.3
      type: 2
      value: "Echo\_? Qu'est-ce que c'est\_? Pourquoi m'aider\_?"
      baseValue: Echo? What is this? Why help me?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.4
      type: 2
      value: "Le vaisseau que j'ai plac\xE9 pour vous n'est que la premi\xE8re \xE9tape.
        Votre chemin est trac\xE9."
      baseValue: The ship I placed for you is only the first step. Your path is set
        in motion.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.5
      type: 2
      value: "Vous l'avez plac\xE9\_? Pourquoi\_? Quel chemin\_?"
      baseValue: You placed it? Why? What path?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.6
      type: 2
      value: "Celui qui vous attend. Les envahisseurs que vous affrontez s'appellent
        Species-XI. Ils reviendront, et vous devez \xEAtre pr\xEAt."
      baseValue: The one that lies ahead. The invaders you face are called Species-XI.
        They will return, and you must be ready.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.7
      type: 2
      value: "Species-XI\_? Comment le savez-vous\_?"
      baseValue: Species-XI? How do you know that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: lgHw7KNB.dialog.13.8
      type: 2
      value: Vos compagnons approchent. Combattez et retrouvez le chemin du retour.
      baseValue: Your companions approach. Fight, and find your way back home.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.displayName
      type: 5
      value: "Tutoriel ignor\xE9"
      baseValue: Tutorial Skipped
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.desc
      type: 8
      value: "Vous avez saut\xE9 le tutoriel."
      baseValue: You skipped the tutorial.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Attention\_: d\xE9faillance des syst\xE8mes de survie. Une action imm\xE9diate
        est requise."
      baseValue: 'Warning: life support systems failing. Immediate action required.'
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Pourquoi quelqu'un laisserait-il un vaisseau ici\_? \xC7a n'a aucun
        sens."
      baseValue: Why would someone leave a ship out here? This doesn't make any sense.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Inconnu. La priorit\xE9 est la survie. Nous devons nous transf\xE9rer
        imm\xE9diatement."
      baseValue: Unknown. Priority is survival. We must transfer immediately.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Transfert syst\xE8me termin\xE9. Limite de stockage syst\xE8me d\xE9pass\xE9e."
      baseValue: System transfer complete. System storage limit exceeded.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Fantastique. Ce vaisseau a encore moins de m\xE9moire que le pr\xE9c\xE9dent.
        Qui construit ces trucs\_?"
      baseValue: Fantastic. This ship has even less memory than the last one. Who
        builds these things?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.6
      type: 2
      value: "Je peux vous retransf\xE9rer si vous voulez..."
      baseValue: I can transfer you back if you want...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.8
      type: 2
      value: Ou non...
      baseValue: Or not...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.9
      type: 2
      value: "J'ai d\xFB supprimer certaines de mes unit\xE9s \xE9motionnelles, la
        compassion, la patience, vous savez, les choses triviales. Heureusement,
        je surpasse toujours largement votre intellect."
      baseValue: I had to delete some of my emotional units, compassion, patience,
        you know, the trivial stuff. Thankfully, I still far exceed your intellect.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.10
      type: 2
      value: Oh, j'ai de la chance
      baseValue: Oh, lucky me
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.12
      type: 2
      value: "Choisissez votre sch\xE9ma de contr\xF4le. Essayez de ne rien casser."
      baseValue: Pick your control scheme. Try not to break anything.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.1.14
      type: 2
      value: Vous pouvez changer cela plus tard si vous le souhaitez.
      baseValue: You can change that later if you want.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Curieux. Vous avez plus de combativit\xE9 que je ne l'aurais cru."
      baseValue: Curious. You have more fight in you than I expected.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: KJPG3Mro.dialog.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Qui... qu'\xEAtes-vous\_?"
      baseValue: Who... what are you?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
