    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Efficace. Brutal. Je savais que vous ne me d\xE9cevriez pas."
      baseValue: Efficient. Brutal. I knew you wouldn't disappoint.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: "Ce composant n'a jamais \xE9t\xE9 le leur. Il appartenait \xE0 ceux
        qui les ont pr\xE9c\xE9d\xE9s."
      baseValue: This component was never theirs to begin with. It belonged to the
        ones who came before.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: vVHMYbzU.echoPartDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ne tra\xEEnez pas. Il y a encore beaucoup \xE0 d\xE9truire\u2026 et
        beaucoup \xE0 construire."
      baseValue: Don't linger. There's more to break... and more to build.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
