    - key: x4GIvJUI.name
      type: 5
      value: Lumenveil
      baseValue: Lumenveil
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "M\xEAme la Flora, si d\xE9sesp\xE9r\xE9e de pr\xE9server la nature,
        s'accrochait \xE0 des reliques qu'elle comprenait \xE0 peine."
      baseValue: Even the Flora, so desperate to preserve nature, clung to relics
        they barely comprehended.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: x4GIvJUI.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Encore une pi\xE8ce revendiqu\xE9e... le concept devient plus clair
        \xE0 chacune d'elles."
      baseValue: Another piece claimed... the design grows clearer with each one.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.name
      type: 5
      value: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      baseValue: "Mj\xF6lnir"
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 1
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.0
      type: 2
      value: "Encore vous... Pourquoi collectionnez-vous ces pi\xE8ces\_?"
      baseValue: You again... What are you collecting these parts for?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.1
      type: 2
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ce n'est pas une technologie Phantom. Elle a \xE9t\xE9 con\xE7ue par
        les Architectes\u2026 ceux qui ont sem\xE9 la vie parmi les \xE9toiles."
      baseValue: This isn't Phantom technology. It was crafted by the Architects...
        the ones who seeded life across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.3
      type: 2
      value: "Avant qu'ils ne perdent leur but... et ne disparaissent dans leur propre
        lumi\xE8re."
      baseValue: Before they lost their purpose... and vanished into their own light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: 7iLARRe1.echoPartDialog.4
      type: 2
      value: Je la revendique pour un but plus noble. Vous verrez quand le moment
        sera venu.
      baseValue: I'm claiming it for a higher purpose. When the time comes you will
        see.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
