    - key: faction.Conclave.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Le dernier grand empire humain, unifi\xE9 sous l'Empereur apr\xE8s
        que les guerres plan\xE9taires ont failli an\xE9antir l'humanit\xE9. Son
        gouvernement militariste place l'ordre, la stabilit\xE9 et la force au-dessus
        de tout. Les citoyens m\xE8nent une vie prosp\xE8re soutenue par une IA avanc\xE9e
        et l'automatisation, avec un service militaire obligatoire pour chaque adulte.
        Le Conclave se consid\xE8re comme le bouclier de l'humanit\xE9 face \xE0
        une galaxie hostile."
      baseValue: "The last great human empire, unified under the Emperor after the
        planetary wars nearly wiped humanity out. Its militaristic government values
        order, stability, and strength above all else. Citizens live prosperous lives
        supported by advanced AI and automation, with mandatory military service
        for every adult. The Conclave sees itself as humanity\u2019s shield against
        a hostile galaxy."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Skeran.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Une race brutale anim\xE9e par la conqu\xEAte, la hi\xE9rarchie et
        l'expansion sans fin. Leurs flottes submergent l'ennemi par leur agressivit\xE9
        pure et leur sup\xE9riorit\xE9 num\xE9rique. Les Skeran ont \xE9t\xE9 cr\xE9\xE9s
        et manipul\xE9s \xE0 l'origine par les Fant\xF4mes comme armes vivantes.
        D'innombrables couv\xE9es demeurent encore cach\xE9es au-del\xE0 de l'espace
        explor\xE9."
      baseValue: A brutal race driven by conquest, hierarchy, and endless expansion.
        Their fleets overwhelm enemies through sheer aggression and overwhelming
        numbers. The Skeran were originally created and manipulated by the Phantoms
        as living weapons. Countless broods still remain hidden beyond explored space.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Phantom.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Une esp\xE8ce ancienne et hautement avanc\xE9e qui consid\xE8re les
        civilisations plus jeunes comme primitives et autodestructrices. Ils m\xE9prisent
        le militarisme du Conclave et favorisent le Panth\xE9on pour sa diplomatie.
        Les Fant\xF4mes sont secrets, manipulateurs et patients au-del\xE0 de la
        compr\xE9hension des mortels. Une grande partie des souffrances de la galaxie
        peut \xEAtre attribu\xE9e \xE0 leur ing\xE9rence."
      baseValue: "An ancient and highly advanced species that views younger civilizations
        as primitive and self-destructive. They despise the Conclave\u2019s militarism
        and favor the Pantheon for its diplomacy. The Phantoms are secretive, manipulative,
        and patient beyond mortal understanding. Much of the galaxy\u2019s suffering
        can be traced back to their interference."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Flora.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Une esp\xE8ce v\xE9g\xE9tale sentiente qui a \xE9volu\xE9 ind\xE9pendamment
        de la vie animale au sein du Secteur 3. Elle consid\xE8re les civilisations
        animales comme des parasites violents corrompant l'ordre naturel. Farouchement
        protectrice de son territoire, la Flora r\xE9pond agressivement \xE0 toute
        intrusion sur ses mondes. Pour elle, l'industrie et l'expansion sont des
        maladies qui doivent finalement \xEAtre \xE9radiqu\xE9es."
      baseValue: A sentient plant species that evolved independently from animal
        life within Sector 3. They see animal-based civilizations as violent parasites
        corrupting the natural order. Fiercely protective of their territory, the
        Flora respond aggressively to any intrusion into their worlds. To them, industry
        and expansion are diseases that must eventually be purged.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Species-XI.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Entit\xE9s horrifiques venues du vide au-del\xE0 des portails. Elles
        se propagent comme une infection, corrompant vaisseaux, technologies et cr\xE9atures
        vivantes. Elles apparaissent simplement et se mettent \xE0 d\xE9truire tout
        sur leur passage, sans qu'aucune tentative de communication n'ait jamais
        \xE9t\xE9 observ\xE9e. On comprend tr\xE8s peu leur v\xE9ritable nature,
        car la plupart des rencontres se terminent par une annihilation totale."
      baseValue: Horrific entities from the void beyond the gateways. They spread
        like an infection, corrupting ships, technology, and living creatures. They
        simply appear and begin destroying everything in their path, with no attempts
        at communication ever observed. Very little is understood about their true
        nature, as most encounters end in total annihilation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Grays.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "De myst\xE9rieux extraterrestres obs\xE9d\xE9s par l'exp\xE9rimentation
        g\xE9n\xE9tique et la perfection biologique. Ils \xE9vitent la guerre ouverte
        et privil\xE9gient les enl\xE8vements, l'observation et la manipulation clandestine.
        Les rencontres avec les Gris sont rares, cliniques et profond\xE9ment troublantes\_;
        les victimes disparaissent souvent sans explication. La plupart des civilisations
        rejettent les histoires \xE0 leur sujet comme des th\xE9ories du complot,
        jusqu'\xE0 ce qu'elles soient elles-m\xEAmes enlev\xE9es."
      baseValue: Mysterious extraterrestrials obsessed with genetic experimentation
        and biological perfection. They avoid open warfare, instead relying on abductions,
        observation, and covert manipulation. Encounters with the Grays are rare,
        clinical, and deeply unsettling, with victims often disappearing without
        explanation. Most civilizations dismiss stories about them as conspiracy
        theories until they are taken themselves.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Neutral.backstory
      type: 8
      value: 
      baseValue: 
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Forgotten.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Une faction rebelle de Fant\xF4mes qui a rejet\xE9 le d\xE9clin de
        leur esp\xE8ce et embrass\xE9 la domination \xE0 la place. Ils se croient
        sup\xE9rieurs \xE0 toute autre forme de vie et cherchent \xE0 asservir les
        civilisations plus faibles. Les Oubli\xE9s interf\xE8rent ouvertement avec
        les races plus jeunes et les manipulent partout o\xF9 ils les trouvent. Leurs
        mondes regorgent de technologies anciennes d\xE9tourn\xE9es en outils de
        contr\xF4le."
      baseValue: A rogue faction of Phantoms who rejected the decline of their species
        and embraced domination instead. They believe themselves superior to all
        other life and seek to enslave weaker civilizations. The Forgotten openly
        interfere with and manipulate younger races wherever they find them. Their
        worlds are filled with ancient technology twisted into tools of control.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Shadow.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Unit\xE9s d'infiltration Skeran sp\xE9cialis\xE9es, cr\xE9\xE9es par
        les Fant\xF4mes pour le sabotage et la guerre clandestine. Elles frappent
        depuis l'obscurit\xE9, tendant des embuscades \xE0 leurs cibles et volant
        des technologies avant de dispara\xEEtre \xE0 nouveau. Leurs vaisseaux sont
        rapides, pr\xE9dateurs et con\xE7us pour r\xE9pandre la peur autant que la
        destruction. M\xEAme les autres Skeran les regardent avec inqui\xE9tude."
      baseValue: Specialized Skeran infiltration units created by the Phantoms for
        sabotage and covert warfare. They strike from darkness, ambushing targets
        and stealing technology before disappearing again. Their ships are fast,
        predatory, and designed to spread fear as much as destruction. Even other
        Skeran regard them with unease.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Junker.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Pirates, d\xE9serteurs et charognards vivant dans les ceintures d'ast\xE9ro\xEFdes
        en fusion du Secteur 1. La plupart sont d'anciens citoyens du Conclave qui
        ont abandonn\xE9 la vie militaire et survivent d\xE9sormais gr\xE2ce au pillage
        et \xE0 la contrebande. Leurs vaisseaux sont assembl\xE9s \xE0 partir de
        technologies vol\xE9es et r\xE9cup\xE9r\xE9es, maintenus par le d\xE9sespoir.
        En territoire Ferrailleur, la survie compte plus que la loyaut\xE9 ou la
        loi."
      baseValue: Pirates, deserters, and scavengers living within the molten asteroid
        belts of Sector 1. Most are former Conclave citizens who abandoned military
        life and now survive through raiding and smuggling. Their ships are assembled
        from stolen and salvaged technology held together through desperation. In
        Junker territory, survival matters more than loyalty or law.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Outcast.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Des humains rendus fous par l'usage excessif de technologies exp\xE9rimentales
        telles que les propulseurs temporels. Leur esprit s'est fractur\xE9 au point
        qu'ils se croient illumin\xE9s, dot\xE9s de v\xE9rit\xE9s que le reste de
        l'humanit\xE9 ne peut saisir. Leurs vaisseaux se d\xE9placent de mani\xE8re
        impr\xE9visible au combat, se d\xE9phasant et d\xE9formant le temps lui-m\xEAme.
        M\xEAme le Conclave craint ce que sont devenus les Parias."
      baseValue: Humans driven mad through overuse of experimental technologies such
        as Temporal Drives. Their minds have fractured to the point that they believe
        themselves enlightened, gifted with truths the rest of humanity cannot grasp.
        Their ships move unpredictably through combat, phasing and distorting time
        itself. Even the Conclave fears what the Outcasts have become.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Pantheon.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "Descendants des transfuges du Conclave qui ont fui la Terre pour b\xE2tir
        une soci\xE9t\xE9 d\xE9mocratique lib\xE9r\xE9e du joug imp\xE9rial. Ils
        estiment que le Conclave est devenu obs\xE9d\xE9 par la guerre et le contr\xF4le,
        sacrifiant l'avenir de l'humanit\xE9 au passage. Leurs id\xE9aux pacifiques
        leur ont valu une alliance avec les anciens Fant\xF4mes, leur ouvrant l'acc\xE8s
        \xE0 une technologie puissante. Le Panth\xE9on se consid\xE8re comme l'avenir
        de l'humanit\xE9."
      baseValue: "Descendants of Conclave defectors who fled Earth to build a democratic
        society free from imperial rule. They believe the Conclave has become obsessed
        with war and control, sacrificing humanity\u2019s future in the process.
        Their peaceful ideals earned them an alliance with the ancient Phantoms,
        granting access to powerful technology. The Pantheon sees itself as the future
        of mankind."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.Sentinel.backstory
      type: 8
      value: "D\xE9fenseurs d'\xE9lite de la Terre et forces militaires personnelles
        de l'Empereur. Ils servent directement sous les ordres du Grand Mar\xE9chal
        Vex, agissant comme garde royale. Leurs flottes sont lourdement arm\xE9es,
        disciplin\xE9es et totalement implacables au combat. L'arriv\xE9e des forces
        Sentinelle signifie g\xE9n\xE9ralement que la situation est d\xE9j\xE0 devenue
        critique."
      baseValue: "Elite defenders of Earth and the Emperor\u2019s personal military
        forces. They serve directly under Grand Marshal Vex, acting as royal guard.
        Their fleets are heavily armed, disciplined, and completely unforgiving in
        battle. The arrival of Sentinel forces usually means the situation has already
        become critical."
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog1
      type: 2
      value: "Enfin\_! Nous chargeons l'hyperpropulsion, aidez-nous \xE0 les retenir\_!"
      baseValue: Finally! We're charging the hyperdrive, help hold them off!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog2
      type: 2
      value: "Lou\xE9 soit l'Empereur. Nous serons partis d'ici en un rien de temps,
        tenez-les \xE0 distance\_!"
      baseValue: Thank the Emperor. We'll be out of here in no time just hold them
        off!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog3
      type: 2
      value: "D'autres hostiles arrivent. Attention\_!"
      baseValue: We have more hostiles incoming. Watch out!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.rescueDialog4
      type: 2
      value: "Ils pr\xE9parent une attaque plus importante. Soyez pr\xEAt\_!"
      baseValue: They're gearing up for a bigger attack. Get ready!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous p\xE9n\xE9trez en territoire Skeran. Partez imm\xE9diatement,
        ou vous serez d\xE9truit\_!"
      baseValue: You are trespassing in Skeran space. Leave now, or be destroyed!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.1
      type: 2
      value: Directement aux menaces. Charmant.
      baseValue: Straight to the threats. Charming.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.2
      type: 2
      value: Ils ne bluffent pas.
      baseValue: They're not bluffing.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Non, ils ne bluffent pas. Pr\xE9parez-vous..."
      baseValue: No, they're not. Get ready...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.0
      type: 2
      value: Impressionnant. Vous avez combattu jusqu'ici, mais il vous faudra lutter
        encore plus fort pour atteindre la Terre.
      baseValue: Impressive. You've fought your way this far, but you'll need to
        fight harder to reach Earth.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Consid\xE9rez ceci comme un signe de mon\u2026 soutien."
      baseValue: Consider this a token of my... support.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Pourquoi\_? Pourquoi nous aider\_?"
      baseValue: Why? Why help us?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "De l'aide\_? Non. Je g\xE8re une variable. Vous en b\xE9n\xE9ficiez,
        c'est tout."
      baseValue: Help? No. I'm managing a variable. You just happen to benefit.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Vous n'avez qu'un seul chemin \xE0 suivre\_: continuez \xE0 avancer."
      baseValue: You have only one path. Fight your way forward.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vos victoires ne signifient rien. Nous serons victorieux\_!"
      baseValue: Your wins mean nothing. We will be victorious!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.1
      type: 2
      value: Il semble qu'ils n'aient pas de fin...
      baseValue: There seems to be no end to them...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ils sont implacables, une race de guerriers con\xE7ue pour la guerre."
      baseValue: They're relentless, a warrior race built for war.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous osez d\xE9fier la puissance des Skerans\_? Vous n'atteindrez jamais
        la Citadelle\_!"
      baseValue: You dare challenge the might of the Skeran? You will never reach
        the Citadel!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.1
      type: 2
      value: "Les Fant\xF4mes n'ont pas pu nous vaincre, et vous non plus\_!"
      baseValue: The Phantoms could not defeat us, neither will you!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.skeran.5.2
      type: 2
      value: "De grands mots pour une esp\xE8ce sur le point de perdre un autre combat."
      baseValue: Big words for a species about to lose another fight.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Merde, une embuscade, pr\xE9parez-vous \xE0..."
      baseValue: Damn, an ambush prepare to...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Quoi... que vient-il de se passer\_?"
      baseValue: What... what just happened?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Nos capteurs n'ont m\xEAme pas d\xE9tect\xE9 \xE7a. Quel genre d'\xE9nergie
        utilise-t-elle\_?"
      baseValue: That didn't even register on our sensors. What kind of power is
        she using?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Consid\xE9rez cela comme une r\xE9compense pour avoir choisi le chemin
        le plus difficile."
      baseValue: Take this as a reward for choosing the harder path.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Pourquoi faites-vous \xE7a\_?"
      baseValue: Why are you doing this?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Disons simplement que ce chemin nous profite \xE0 tous les deux."
      baseValue: Let's just say this path benefits us both.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.6
      type: 2
      value: "Vous vous attendez vraiment \xE0 ce qu'on vous fasse confiance\_?"
      baseValue: You really expect us to trust that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.1.7
      type: 2
      value: "Confiance\_? Non. Mais la prochaine \xE9tape est claire. Votre chemin
        vers la maison est sem\xE9 d'ennemis, et il vous faudra plus que des questions
        pour survivre."
      baseValue: Trust? No. But the next step is clear. Your way home is littered
        with enemies, and you'll need more than questions to survive.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Le Conclave revient, s'accrochant \xE0 ses anciennes habitudes. Apprendrez-vous
        un jour\_?"
      baseValue: The Conclave returns, clinging to its old ways. Will you ever learn?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Les Fant\xF4mes sont exactement ce qu'on attend d'une race immortelle.
        Arrogants, condescendants\u2026 friands de monologues."
      baseValue: Phantoms are exactly what you'd expect from an immortal race. Arrogant,
        condescending... fond of monologues.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ils ne nous invitent pas vraiment \xE0 prendre le th\xE9, hein\_?"
      baseValue: Not exactly inviting us to tea, are they?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Votre esp\xE8ce ne conna\xEEt que la guerre. Nous ne vous laisserons
        pas l'amener ici."
      baseValue: Your kind knows only war. We will not let you bring it here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.0
      type: 2
      value: Ceux qui ont construit les portails n'ont jamais compris la souffrance
        qu'ils apporteraient.
      baseValue: The ones who built the gateways never understood the suffering they'd
        bring.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Souffrir\_? \xC0 cause des portails\_?"
      baseValue: Suffering? From the Gateways?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ils ont parcouru les \xE9toiles et n'ont trouv\xE9 que le silence...
        alors ils ont cr\xE9\xE9 la vie pour combler le vide."
      baseValue: They scoured the stars and found only silence... so they made life
        to fill the emptiness.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Mais leurs pr\xE9cieux portails ont illumin\xE9 le vide... aveuglant
        ce qui n'aurait jamais d\xFB voir la lumi\xE8re."
      baseValue: But their precious gateways lit up the void... blinding what should
        never have seen the light.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons vu d'innombrables civilisations s'\xE9lever et tomber, leurs
        cendres dispers\xE9es \xE0 travers les \xE9toiles."
      baseValue: We have seen countless civilizations rise and fall, their ashes
        scattered across the stars.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Le Conclave ne sera pas diff\xE9rent."
      baseValue: The Conclave will be no different.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "On dirait que vous \xEAtes l\xE0 depuis toujours."
      baseValue: You sound like you've been around forever.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons assist\xE9 \xE0 la naissance et \xE0 la mort des \xE9toiles,
        \xE0 la chute de tyrans qui se croyaient \xE9ternels."
      baseValue: We have watched the birth and death of stars, the fall of tyrants
        who thought themselves eternal.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.4
      type: 2
      value: "Ne pensez pas que vous nous briserez aussi facilement que vous l'avez
        fait avec nos animaux de compagnie d\xE9sob\xE9issants."
      baseValue: Do not think you will break us as easily as you did our disobedient
        pets.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.3.5
      type: 2
      value: Alors mettez-nous sur votre liste de morts... et regardez ce qui se
        passe ensuite.
      baseValue: Then put us on your list of fallen... and watch what happens next.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.0
      type: 2
      value: Vous en aurez besoin.
      baseValue: You'll need this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Pourquoi\_?"
      baseValue: Why?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ce n'est pas ici que vous mourez. \xC7a viendra plus tard."
      baseValue: This isn't the part where you die. That comes later.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.3
      type: 2
      value: Charmant...
      baseValue: Delightful...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.speciesxi.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Au moins, il ne parle plus par \xE9nigmes\_!"
      baseValue: At least it's not speaking in riddles anymore!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous exercez le pouvoir sans en comprendre le co\xFBt."
      baseValue: You wield power without understanding its cost.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.1
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons g\xE9r\xE9 tout ce que vous nous avez confi\xE9 jusqu'\xE0
        pr\xE9sent."
      baseValue: We've handled everything you've thrown at us so far.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.2
      type: 2
      value: "Tout simplement parce que nous le permettons\_!"
      baseValue: Only because we allow it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.3
      type: 2
      value: "Les Skeran \xE9taient nos cr\xE9ations... il y en avait d'autres, bien
        plus grandes, perdues dans le temps."
      baseValue: The Skeran were our creations... there were others, far greater,
        lost to time
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.phantom.4.4
      type: 2
      value: "Vous vous battez pour le contr\xF4le d'une galaxie que nous avons fa\xE7onn\xE9e,
        sans jamais remettre en question les ruines sous vos pieds."
      baseValue: You fight for control of a galaxy we shaped, never questioning the
        ruins beneath your feet.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Faites demi-tour, animal. N'amenez pas l'Invocatrice du N\xE9ant ici."
      baseValue: Turn back, animal. Do not bring the Void Caller here.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Et qui est-ce au juste\_?"
      baseValue: And who exactly is that?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ses sbires vous poursuivent d\xE9j\xE0. Nous vous \xE9liminerons avant
        leur arriv\xE9e."
      baseValue: Her minions pursue you even now. We will remove you before they
        arrive.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "J'ai trouv\xE9 ceci."
      baseValue: I found this.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Oh, vous nous aidez de nouveau\_?"
      baseValue: Oh, you're helping us again?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Seul, vous avez \xE9chou\xE9. Ensemble, nous pouvons encore progresser."
      baseValue: Alone, you floundered. Together we may yet make progress.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Elle juge votre vis\xE9e parce que votre vis\xE9e est mauvaise..."
      baseValue: It's judging your aiming because your aiming is bad...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.0
      type: 2
      value: "Votre pollution se r\xE9pand dans tout notre jardin."
      baseValue: Your pollution spreads throughout our garden.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.1
      type: 2
      value: "Pollution\_? Je fais tourner ces propulseurs \xE0 pr\xE8s de 0,5\_%
        d'\xE9missions..."
      baseValue: Pollution? I've got these thrusters running at nearly 0.5% emissions...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.2
      type: 2
      value: "Je crois que c'\xE9tait une m\xE9taphore. Je pensais que vous les aviez
        comprises\_?"
      baseValue: I think that was a metaphor. I thought you understood those?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.flora.3.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ah oui, c'est vrai, nous sommes la pollution... compris\_!"
      baseValue: Oh right, we're the pollution... got it!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vaisseau du Conclave, vous venez de faire notre journ\xE9e. Coupez
        l'alimentation et on fera vite."
      baseValue: Conclave ship, you just made our day. Power down and we'll make
        this quick.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Charmant. Des pirates ambitieux\u2026 et sans le moindre instinct de
        conservation."
      baseValue: Lovely. Pirates with ambition... and zero self-preservation.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous avez calcin\xE9 notre \xE9quipage. Nous sommes l\xE0 pour vous
        rendre la pareille\u2026 avec int\xE9r\xEAts."
      baseValue: You torched our crew. We're here to return the favor... with interest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.junker.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Pas encore ces abrutis. Ils r\xE9apparaissent ou ils se multiplient\_?"
      baseValue: Not these meatheads again. Do they respawn, or just multiply?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "J'ai travers\xE9 hier... et je suis revenu de demain."
      baseValue: I have walked through yesterday... and returned from tomorrow.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Fantastique. Des accros au temps avec un complexe de divinit\xE9."
      baseValue: Fantastic. Temporal junkies with a god complex.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Que recherchent-ils vraiment\_?"
      baseValue: What are they even after?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Transcendance... ou peut-\xEAtre une s\xE9ance de m\xE9ditation de
        groupe \xE0 la fin des temps."
      baseValue: Transcendence... or maybe a group meditation session at the end
        of time.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous \xEAtes pi\xE9g\xE9 dans le pr\xE9sent... et le futur ne veut
        plus de vous."
      baseValue: You are trapped in the present... and the future no longer wants
        you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "C'est la D\xE9rive Temporelle qui parle. Leur esprit est d\xE9r\xE9gl\xE9."
      baseValue: That's the Temporal Drift talking. Their minds are scrambled.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "On vous entend, fant\xF4me tic-tac\_! Vos pens\xE9es lin\xE9aires trahissent
        votre faiblesse\_!"
      baseValue: We hear you, ticking ghost! Your linear thoughts betray your weakness!
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Attendez\u2026 ils m'entendent\_? Ce n'est pas comme \xE7a que c'est
        cens\xE9 marcher."
      baseValue: Wait... they can hear me? That's not how this is supposed to work.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.outcast.2.4
      type: 2
      value: "Nous sommes sortis de votre temps. Vous ne pouvez pas saisir ce qui
        s'est d\xE9j\xE0 produit."
      baseValue: We've stepped outside your time. You can't catch what's already
        happened.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous errez l\xE0 o\xF9 la lumi\xE8re n'atteint pas... et vous ne voyez
        pas ce qui suit."
      baseValue: You wander where the light does not reach... and do not see what
        follows.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Cryptique et d\xE9rangeant. Exactement ce \xE0 quoi je m'attendais."
      baseValue: Cryptic and unsettling. Just what I expected.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "La chasse est d\xE9j\xE0 termin\xE9e."
      baseValue: The hunt is already over.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Je pense que c'est leur fa\xE7on de dire que nous sommes en difficult\xE9."
      baseValue: I think that's their way of saying we're in trouble.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Cette connaissance ne vous \xE9tait pas destin\xE9e."
      baseValue: This knowledge was never meant for you.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "On dirait qu'ils fouillent des \xE9paves... probablement de la technologie
        Fant\xF4me."
      baseValue: Sounds like they're scavenging... probably Phantom tech.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.shadow.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Super. Encore des armes vol\xE9es \xE0 retourner contre nous."
      baseValue: Great. More stolen weapons to turn against us.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Un vaisseau solitaire... \xE9gar\xE9 par des forces au-del\xE0 de sa
        compr\xE9hension."
      baseValue: A lone ship... led astray by forces beyond their understanding.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Je ne sais m\xEAme pas qui vous \xEAtes..."
      baseValue: I don't even know who you are...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "\xC9videmment que non. Vos ma\xEEtres effacent bien des choses de votre
        histoire."
      baseValue: Of course you don't. Your masters erase many things from your history.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Nous avons fui leur tyrannie. Nous sommes d\xE9sormais aux c\xF4t\xE9s
        des v\xE9ritables puissances."
      baseValue: We walked away from their tyranny. Now we stand with true powers.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.4
      type: 2
      value: "Des fant\xF4mes\_? Vous avez \xE9chang\xE9 un ma\xEEtre contre un autre..."
      baseValue: Phantoms? You traded one master for another...
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.1.5
      type: 2
      value: "Un ma\xEEtre exige l'ob\xE9issance... un mentor partage la sagesse."
      baseValue: A master demands obedience... a mentor shares wisdom.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Le fant\xF4me du vide peut vous ramener chez vous... mais pas pour
        votre bien."
      baseValue: The ghost from the void may lead you home... but not for your sake.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Que savez-vous des fant\xF4mes\_?"
      baseValue: What do you know of ghosts?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.pantheon.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Que m\xEAme les plus anciens d'entre nous savent craindre l'obscurit\xE9."
      baseValue: That even the oldest among us know to fear the darkness.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.0
      type: 2
      value: Vous entrez dans des ombres anciennes, pion du Conclave.
      baseValue: You step into ancient shadows, Conclave pawn.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Encore des Fant\xF4mes\_? Vous ne ressemblez pas aux autres."
      baseValue: More Phantoms? You don't sound like the rest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.2
      type: 2
      value: Nous ne sommes pas leurs vestiges. Nous sommes leur perfection.
      baseValue: We are not their remnants. We are their perfection.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Agenouillez-vous, ou soyez d\xE9faits."
      baseValue: Kneel, or be unmade.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vous portez les cha\xEEnes de vos ma\xEEtres comme des m\xE9dailles."
      baseValue: You wear your masters' chains like medals.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Mieux que de v\xE9n\xE9rer les ruines d'un empire en ruine."
      baseValue: Better than worshipping the ruins of a failed empire.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Ils ne sont pas seulement dans l'illusion\u2026 ils sont nostalgiques
        et dangereux."
      baseValue: They're not just deluded... they're nostalgic and dangerous.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.forgotten.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Nous ne v\xE9n\xE9rons pas le pass\xE9. Nous le corrigeons."
      baseValue: We do not worship the past. We correct it.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.0
      type: 2
      value: "Vaisseau humain. Structure g\xE9n\xE9tique confirm\xE9e. Pr\xE9parez-vous
        \xE0 la collecte."
      baseValue: Human vessel. Genetic structure confirmed. Prepare for collection.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.1
      type: 2
      value: "Attendez. Est-ce que... on se fait vraiment enlever\_?"
      baseValue: Wait. Is this... are we actually getting abducted?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.2
      type: 2
      value: "Des Gris. Bien s\xFBr, des Gris. J'aurais d\xFB apporter un chapeau
        en papier aluminium."
      baseValue: Grays. Of course, it's Grays. Should've brought a tinfoil hat.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.1.3
      type: 2
      value: "Ne r\xE9sistez pas. La conformit\xE9 garantit une perte tissulaire
        minimale."
      baseValue: Do not resist. Compliance ensures minimal tissue loss.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.0
      type: 2
      value: "Sujet toujours non coop\xE9ratif. Passage au protocole de confinement
        secondaire."
      baseValue: Subject remains noncompliant. Proceeding with secondary containment
        protocol.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.1
      type: 2
      value: "Vous n'essayez pas s\xE9rieusement de m'enlever\_?"
      baseValue: You're not seriously still trying to abduct me?
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.2
      type: 2
      value: "Si, si. Et \xE0 en juger par le pic sur le scanner\u2026 ils ont apport\xE9
        un plus grand bocal."
      baseValue: They are. And judging by the scanner spike... they brought a bigger
        jar.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
    - key: faction.grays.2.3
      type: 2
      value: "Dommages tissulaires acceptables. D\xE9but de la r\xE9colte."
      baseValue: Tissue damage acceptable. Begin harvest.
      context: 
      aiTranslated: 1
      keptEnglish: 0
